{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cSupercar Collection Simulator Demo\u201d is a game where you can collect cars and earn money by selling surprise car boxes.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453690/extras/Gif_SupercarSeries.gif?t=1740508379\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and offer for sale different Supercar series. Each series has different features and advantages.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453690/extras/Gif_RacingPlatforms.gif?t=1740508379\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set up racing platforms in your store and allow players to race. Make money from racing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453690/extras/Gif_StoreManagement.gif?t=1740508379\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your Supercar store the way you want. Unlock the Supercar series, order surprise boxes, and place them on your shelves to make sales. Create the perfect store for lovers of collectibles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453690/extras/Gif_SupercarCollection.gif?t=1740508379\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enrich your collection with cars from Supercar boxes. Find and sell rare and valuable cars for a profit, or collect them to complete your collection with that Job Simulator.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453690/extras/Gif_GrowBusiness.gif?t=1740508379\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attract more customers by upgrading your store! Win new customers and increase your profits with new shelves, racing platforms, Supercar boxes, and collectibles.\u00a0<br><br>It will be your best\u00a0Hobby &amp; Job Simulation g